					<description><![CDATA[<p>Running a veterinary practice smoothly requires more than expert care, it needs a clinic layout that supports staff, pets, and clients. Thoughtful space planning can dramatically improve workflow, reduce stress, and increase productivity. From consultation room placement to staff movement, optimising your clinic layout ensures everyone (from your team to your patients) has the best [&#8230;]</p>
