					<description><![CDATA[<p>A veterinary clinic fitout is a specialised type of commercial interior build, but with very specific requirements that general offices or retail spaces don’t face. These unique demands stem from the nature of animal healthcare,&#160;mixing clinical medicine with animal behaviour, hygiene needs, and&#160;the best&#160;operational efficiency. Sparked an interest? Have a look at a past vet [&#8230;]</p>
