					<description><![CDATA[<p>Ever wondered how Passive Houses stay comfy year-round? Maintaining consistent internal temperature so homes are warm in winter and cool in summer? Well, it’s all in the design! From super installation and airtight construction to high performance windows and ventilation with heat recovery, the features of a passive house are carefully selected and designed retaining [&#8230;]</p>
<p>The post <a href="https://timdayconstruction.co.uk/the-core-principles-of-a-passive-house/">The Core Principles of a Passive House</a> appeared first on <a href="https://timdayconstruction.co.uk">Building Contractor | Canterbury, Kent</a>.</p>
